@startuml 08_sequence_sync_c3mr
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #0284C7
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
    BorderColor #1E40AF
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
}

' ==============================================================================
' SUMBER IMPLEMENTASI:
' 1. routes/web.php (Route::post('/c3mr/sync/all', [C3mrSyncController::class, 'syncAll']))
' 2. app/Http/Controllers/C3mrSyncController.php (syncAll)
' 3. app/Services/C3mrSyncService.php (syncAll, syncReportPrq, syncViseepro, syncDataAll, syncCaring, syncPerformance, consolidateAr)
' 4. app/Imports/ReportPrqImport.php, app/Imports/ViseeproImport.php
' 5. resources/views/c3mr/sync.blade.php (fetch API caller)
' ==============================================================================

actor "Tim Collection" as User
participant "Browser (UI)" as Browser
participant "C3mrSyncController" as Controller
participant "C3mrSyncService" as Service
participant "Google Spreadsheet" as GSheet <<External>>
database "MySQL Database" as DB

User -> Browser: Klik tombol "Sync Data C3MR"
activate Browser
Browser -> Browser: Tampilkan spinner loading & disable tombol
Browser -> Controller: POST /c3mr/sync/all (Header: X-CSRF-TOKEN, Accept: application/json)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: C3mrSyncService::syncAll()
activate Service

' Ambil Setting
Service -> DB: Setting::first()
DB --> Service: Ambil c3mr_url & ekstrak Spreadsheet ID

' 1. Sync Report PRQ
Service -> GSheet: HTTP GET export?format=csv&gid=1303511230
GSheet --> Service: CSV Report PRQ
Service -> DB: Excel::import(new ReportPrqImport)\nupdateOrCreate Visit, Customer, ArAgent
DB --> Service: Return jumlah record diproses

' 2. Sync VISEEPRO
Service -> GSheet: HTTP GET export?format=csv&gid=172624186
GSheet --> Service: CSV VISEEPRO
Service -> DB: Excel::import(new ViseeproImport)\nupdateOrCreate ViseeproData
DB --> Service: Return jumlah record diproses

' 3. Sync DATA ALL
Service -> GSheet: HTTP GET gviz/tq?sheet=DATA ALL
GSheet --> Service: CSV DATA ALL
Service -> DB: CustomerSyncService::syncFromDataAllCsv()\nupdateOrCreate Customer (master, kontak, piutang)\nCustomerPhoneEnricher::enrichPhoneNumbers()
DB --> Service: Return jumlah update/create customer

' 4. Sync Caring
Service -> DB: C3mrCaringService::importCaringFromDataAll()\nupdateOrCreate CaringLog (Hasil Caring OBC PRITI)
DB --> Service: Return jumlah record caring

' 5. Sync Performance
Service -> GSheet: HTTP GET gviz/tq?sheet=PERFORMANSI DETAIL
GSheet --> Service: CSV Performansi
Service -> DB: C3mrCaringService::importWitelPerformance()\nupdateOrCreate WitelPerformance
DB --> Service: Return jumlah performansi witel

' 6. Consolidate AR
Service -> DB: ArAgentService::consolidateAgents()\nMerge duplikasi nama & reassign FK visits
DB --> Service: Return final_agent_count

' Simpan Riwayat
Service -> Service: Evaluasi overall status (success/warning)\nHitung total_rows_processed
Service -> DB: Setting::update(last_sync_at, last_sync_status, last_sync_result)
DB --> Service: OK

Service --> Controller: Return array [status, details, total_rows_processed]
deactivate Service

Controller --> Browser: HTTP 200 JSON {status: 'success', total_rows_processed: 302, details: {...}}
deactivate Controller

Browser -> Browser: Update status kartu per sumber data\nPerbarui timestamp Last Sync\nSembunyikan loader & re-enable tombol
Browser --> User: Tampilkan feedback notifikasi berhasil
deactivate Browser

@enduml
